            "review_title": "Review at Urban Market",
            "review_text": "Rick K\nWhite Rock, British Columbia, Canada23 contributions\n0\nOutrageously expensive\nMar 2019 • Couples\nBE FOREWARNED if you are planning to buy a breakfast or lunch before departure. This little shop and its partners in crime - there are three food shops - have a captive clientele in the poorly served international departure hall of the Da Nang airport. Their prices are at least three times that of a similar shop outside - four times that of a small local shop. The food and coffe was OK just way over priced and prices only listed in $US.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 7, 2019",
